            <ArticleTitle>[Acupuncture effective not only in China].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>912-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The use of acupuncture in veterinary science is reviewed. The significance of this method under field conditions is discussed. Investigations on the mechanism of action and the effects of acupuncture are also discussed. Statistical studies showed that acupuncture may induce physiological and analgetic effects.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
